{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>金曲歌王王力宏近日在中國杭州開唱，一段火花四射的舞台互動掀起全場尖叫。一名辣妹舞者坐上他的大腿，兩人親密互動，台下的女粉絲作勢崩潰，齊聲喊「放開她」。</p><p>王力宏5月29日至31日在杭州奧體中心體育場「大蓮花」舉行巡迴演唱會。演唱歌曲《美》時，女舞者張鈴茹突然轉身坐上王力宏的大腿，隨後緩緩向前靠近，兩人近距離對視，鼻尖幾乎相觸。</p><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿上，2人貼面互動。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138489481054130176673409.jpeg/z3csrFAR0q-7FHymDTWJxKQQftv8yDVA9zI8T_cyPE8\"/><figcaption>女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿上，2人貼面互動。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多王力宏與女伴舞的貼面熱舞畫面：</p><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491004538720256238907.jpeg/VI2-KMAfZ7670nvOIRbKf4EcHhx-ijBK2cvGiNnLxog\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491002391105536624093.jpeg/Bt8RWy5wjE2_cipfICCdmZkxEhb3fYeAhMn7H4TJ-x8\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491010700546048713289.jpeg/fv0uDsDaA7fyY7eIEDD3bstA9jAsweisVVW1QFVVtUA\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491008724897792473965.jpeg/nd5UquaxQI6jKEv4UsbvRbJdi2Vr6VcCvlWvrr5Vr64\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491006367567872941687.jpeg/1pFFtp1CREZMgMdLWz_DET10NJSVra5m-OAG3vjgBt4\"/><figcaption>女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491004089929728867203.jpeg/29kNOJ1-iAolHLDLFU4oSIV9x_rF4_xLsKziFbCs4hU\"/><figcaption>女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿貼面互動。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491001929732096716483.jpeg/QuGY81SOlkV195JWBCjzXHOXNM7JAoiODe8PWg3vD1o\"/><figcaption>女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿貼面互動。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿貼面互動。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491010167869440527196.jpeg/STcmkdSOPb2BI2_A7xjXgN3Ok0MpyT8EMRD91TEQ_dU\"/><figcaption>女伴舞坐在王力宏大腿貼面互動。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491006090743808521473.jpeg/3S6R4ja4YQ6WP1i6OLm_XieE3YmoQL9igQ-36YEPt-k\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491003720830976476382.jpeg/TB55Ppz0ODrVxUygDM4p21wde4e4YpzEAGZEbQBmRG0\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491001577410560825713.jpeg/ZfuitpMzwzUljtc6sVQiJ5_e64SH0354kf9Bx5H_Qcc\"/><figcaption>女伴舞在王力宏身邊熱舞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王力宏（IG@leehom）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491006812164096173652.jpeg/qEQlz2EUQgSB3AfoTyMKANKD00458lutgci2K4HItis\"/><figcaption>王力宏（IG@leehom）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王力宏（IG@leehom）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491008938807296387409.jpeg/ZMsy2BvJO_pEgPFbSh6iTZ2uWWH5gvNSWUcOZVlHDmU\"/><figcaption>王力宏（IG@leehom）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王力宏（IG@leehom）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491010868318208095182.jpeg/55z35iy4_-o54KK3jIDePqaU267Fgms3GfBcGBnwXBg\"/><figcaption>王力宏（IG@leehom）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王力宏（IG@leehom）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491001346723840360182.jpeg/nCN3hmEnN9tVtJwIWPmAfdptCeawIxDhkyy9e5MsvXs\"/><figcaption>王力宏（IG@leehom）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王力宏（IG@leehom）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491003750191104273049.jpeg/dvncgguMYbE9KWyQ25UnZOb93wKdk80p7tThbe7U4W0\"/><figcaption>王力宏（IG@leehom）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王力宏（IG@leehom）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138491005910388736275043.jpeg/O4uvLV-FkrKju_nYAhSeD0fm4_eCUUM6l4jrPpeI6z4\"/><figcaption>王力宏（IG@leehom）</figcaption></figure><p>現場大熒幕同步放大兩人的互動特寫，深情對視的畫面瞬間引爆全場。</p><p>台下女粉絲更集體「吃醋」，一邊作勢崩潰，一邊高喊「放開她，讓我來」。不少人紛紛舉起手機，搶拍這段演出橋段。</p><p>事實上，這並非粉絲臨場發揮。「放開她，讓我來」早已是王力宏演唱會上的應援語。每逢《美》的演出環節，王力宏都會與舞者上演近距離互動，當氣氛升温到最高點時，台下女粉絲便會默契十足地高喊同一句話，藉此表達對偶像與表演的喜愛與投入感。</p><p>類似場景已在王力宏多場中國大陸演唱會上反覆上演，每當《美》的曖昧互動橋段登場，台下總會響起「放開她，讓我來」的呼喊聲，因此被粉絲笑稱為《美》的「公式化應援」。</p><p>【延伸閲讀】王力宏新女友？瘋傳與身材傲人長髮女貼身合照　女方開腔回應緋聞（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀】王力宏新女友？瘋傳與身材傲人長髮女貼身合照　女方開腔回應緋聞（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945089140232192632071.jpeg/vppRYBLtRL7gMxzyWOTFHKTCZb66INFWdufigXbn4oE\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀】王力宏新女友？瘋傳與身材傲人長髮女貼身合照　女方開腔回應緋聞（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瑋昕（Haezee）因參加商演，跟王力宏、潘瑋柏、陳立農一起拍照，火辣的身材，加上跟王力宏貼在一起，被傳出是新女友，對此，她也澄清此事。（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064943538745118720912386.jpeg/wMCqVLMaUm1vJgE3um41QnIacgntPNiR9LSjefS0o3k\"/><figcaption>黃瑋昕（Haezee）因參加商演，跟王力宏、潘瑋柏、陳立農一起拍照，火辣的身材，加上跟王力宏貼在一起，被傳出是新女友，對此，她也澄清此事。（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945096132530176967403.jpeg/Wg93Tk77JWVtK7ePWb7ME4SbhCpKzdDwqU0paalNKWk\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945090801176576239746.jpeg/_v0U2Gr-MLvpyFfTA2t72qJqqxBZMJ0j55rXM-ea1zM\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945089861652480647812.jpeg/ezk-b6fYYOq-rz4J0VyJOt71jcPPGhbRWwNhN1sDYTc\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945091795357696971652.jpeg/-rs24nGO7PT8ksAmYWofde4PpNRtulhsusAEPrrABD4\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945094156881920583296.jpeg/qsI_FstFdtKVzoStO1gg55ZZ38xPX_qF3kTm9d5E5vU\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251112/1065227399945261056069158.jpeg/7rIkEvxDGRL3qq9ylpLITvfcGHps_1QCvVuKl71bipc\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945098288533504064791.jpeg/XF5v_9pvNOv2X7l_OfdlkotYWF2yakVtZOglo2ToJaM\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945093179478016976140.jpeg/jFu45k2iBlqf1JXHstmF1_eRd5c4pf5I7_tuWO_7blg\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945095318704128650942.jpeg/Zkg3Yvua87lyZURJas8rYhN6BbMfURUimCm2DJgptgw\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945098045132800705943.jpeg/WwwUxJqPrrsd8HknkkbYWwML7orPv_-fUqT621Kk-ts\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945100742201344765489.jpeg/RKN3VEExzAfJbyiWoJFTKL1a7Qm9F_l6t48vKbePLyk\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img al