"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064945098888318976875092.jpeg/jxeF_NSV2C9eiJbjTtfHgQa9Szy8MmIUrhis_a4YrP0\"/><figcaption>Haezee黃瑋昕（haezeeofficial@IG）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T13:20:34.209444+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1584,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}